iation":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-07T16:09:16Z"},{"id":3098701768,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64sm_I","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"3c645995ca8335d925e2e5deac5044af7f5af657","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"### Crash on Android 6 (API 23)\r\nI think we have to give up support for API < 24 here as well, like in Godot 4.x\r\n\r\n\r\n`java.lang.UnsatisfiedLinkError: dlopen failed: cannot locate symbol \"in6addr_any\" referenced by \"/data/app/org.godotengine.firstgodotproject-1/lib/arm/libgodot_android.so\"...`\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n`v3.6.1.stable.official [b1ba98fce]`\r\n\r\n```\r\nwith custom template: \r\n`Godot Engine v3.7.dev.custom_build.ecb6f7aa2`\r\n\r\n1) Android 13,  arm64, OpenGL ES 2.0 Renderer: Adreno (TM) 650\r\n2) Android 8.1, arm64, OpenGL ES 2.0 Renderer: Adreno (TM) 418\r\n3) Android 8.1, arm32, OpenGL ES 2.0 Renderer: Mali-T830\r\n\r\n4) Android 6,   arm32, Adreno 3xx (CRASH)\r\n\r\nOK with '3.6.1' template:\r\nGodot Engine v3.6.1.stable.official.b1ba98fce\r\nOpenGL ES 2.0 Renderer: Adreno (TM) 320\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n<details><summary>crash log</summary>\r\n\r\n```java\r\n--------- beginning of crash\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: FATAL EXCEPTION: main\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: Process: org.godotengine.firstgodotproject, PID: 3011\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: java.lang.UnsatisfiedLinkError: dlopen failed: cannot locate symbol \"in6addr_any\" referenced by \"/data/app/org.godotengine.firstgodotproject-1/lib/arm/libgodot_android.so\"...\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat java.lang.Runtime.loadLibrary(Runtime.java:372)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat java.lang.System.loadLibrary(System.java:1076)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat org.godotengine.godot.GodotLib.<clinit>(GodotLib.java:50)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat org.godotengine.godot.Godot.initializeGodot(Godot.java:695)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat org.godotengine.godot.Godot.onCreate(Godot.java:844)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.Fragment.performCreate(Fragment.java:3099)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.FragmentStateManager.create(FragmentStateManager.java:524)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.FragmentStateManager.moveToExpectedState(FragmentStateManager.java:282)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.FragmentManager.executeOpsTogether(FragmentManager.java:2214)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.FragmentManager.removeRedundantOperationsAndExecute(FragmentManager.java:2109)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.FragmentManager.execSingleAction(FragmentManager.java:2002)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat androidx.fragment.app.BackStackRecord.commitNowAllowingStateLoss(BackStackRecord.java:323)\r\n08-07 22:25:35.256  3011  3011 E AndroidRuntime: \tat org.godotengine.godot.FullScreenGodotApp.onCreate(FullScreenGodotApp.java:74)\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1f4dce03b2d51fcc0a49caf7f95cb3e188f0b962/drivers/unix/net_socket_posix.cpp#L98-L112\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\nmaybe possible solution:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n#if __ANDROID_API__ < 24\r\nconst struct in6_addr my_in6addr_any = IN6ADDR_ANY_INIT;\r\n#define in6addr_any my_in6addr_any\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nBut it is very likely that more similar workarounds are necessary.\r\n\r\n@m4gr3d what is your opinion on this?\r\n\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#pullrequestreview-3098701768","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108433","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-07T20:59:16Z"},{"id":3098717293,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64sqxt","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"3c645995ca8335d925e2e5deac5044af7f5af657","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?u=25817fe797fcc7a812ba9d7f58f593f5a003abbb&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"Looks good!","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108433#pullrequestreview-3098717293","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108433","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-08-07T21:07:06Z"},{"id":3099210272,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc64ujIg","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"3c645995ca8335d925e2e5deac5044af7f5af657","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?u=5f2b0cb28e37393252e96695f2eaa33494930285&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","login":"m4gr3d","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d"},"body":"Looks good!"